    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Wh... who are you? Did you just drop out of the sky?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Get back, get out of here! She... she might be able to fly!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "...I really can't!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_015_lmg"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guard",
        "text": "Identify yourself!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Use your scanner!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "(Sorry, I have to deal with this first!)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Lungmen law enforcement, listen up! I am from Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Hold your fire. I really don't want to have to deal with crossfire while I'm fighting."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I can handle this on my own. You head on to the next roadblock."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Okay then. Back to you guys."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "What's up with this chick?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I'll explain it to you. I'm sure you can figure it out. Probably."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "(Deep breath)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I am Blaze, one of Rhodes Island's elite operators. My current objective is to cripple your combat capabilities."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "The intentions with which you undertook this invasion of a foreign city-state notwithstanding, we aim chiefly to disarm you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Setting aside the injuries and damages you have inflicted upon others, and attendant penalties, any attempt to resist at this point is pointless. Put down your weapons. You still have a chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "Huh? What? You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "My fellow Infected, I give you a choice:"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Surrender at once, and I will escort you to Rhodes Island, and subsequently deposit you somewhere welcoming to Infected."
    },
